{# Contenu par défaut des notifications des attestations de détention et charte informatique (NotificationTargetAttestation), semé à l'installation.
   Texte figé, balises ##…## de GLPI ; nom et destinataires restent dans la classe. #}
{%- block attestation_invitation__fr_FR_subject %}{% verbatim %}Attestation de détention de matériel : ##attestation.campaign##{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block attestation_invitation__fr_FR_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>Bonjour ##attestation.user##,</p><p>Merci de vérifier la liste du matériel qui vous est attribué, puis de la confirmer en signant (ou de nous signaler un écart) avant le ##attestation.deadline## :</p>{% endverbatim %}{{ include('@assetsign/notifications/_item_list.html.twig') }}{% verbatim %}<p><a href="##attestation.url##">Vérifier et signer mon attestation</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block attestation_invitation__en_GB_subject %}{% verbatim %}Equipment holding attestation: ##attestation.campaign##{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block attestation_invitation__en_GB_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>Hello ##attestation.user##,</p><p>Please check the list of equipment assigned to you, then confirm it by signing (or report a discrepancy) before ##attestation.deadline##:</p>{% endverbatim %}{{ include('@assetsign/notifications/_item_list.html.twig') }}{% verbatim %}<p><a href="##attestation.url##">Check and sign my attestation</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block attestation_invitation__es_ES_subject %}{% verbatim %}Certificación de tenencia de material: ##attestation.campaign##{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block attestation_invitation__es_ES_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>Hola ##attestation.user##,</p><p>Compruebe la lista del material que tiene asignado y confírmela firmando (o indíquenos una discrepancia) antes del ##attestation.deadline##:</p>{% endverbatim %}{{ include('@assetsign/notifications/_item_list.html.twig') }}{% verbatim %}<p><a href="##attestation.url##">Comprobar y firmar mi certificación</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block attestation_invitation__de_DE_subject %}{% verbatim %}Bestätigung des Gerätebesitzes: ##attestation.campaign##{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block attestation_invitation__de_DE_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>Hallo ##attestation.user##,</p><p>Bitte prüfen Sie die Liste der Ihnen zugewiesenen Geräte und bestätigen Sie sie mit Ihrer Unterschrift (oder melden Sie eine Abweichung) bis zum ##attestation.deadline##:</p>{% endverbatim %}{{ include('@assetsign/notifications/_item_list.html.twig') }}{% verbatim %}<p><a href="##attestation.url##">Bestätigung prüfen und unterschreiben</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block attestation_invitation__it_IT_subject %}{% verbatim %}Attestazione di detenzione dell'attrezzatura: ##attestation.campaign##{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block attestation_invitation__it_IT_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>Buongiorno ##attestation.user##,</p><p>Verifichi l'elenco dell'attrezzatura a lei assegnata, poi lo confermi firmando (o ci segnali una discrepanza) entro il ##attestation.deadline##:</p>{% endverbatim %}{{ include('@assetsign/notifications/_item_list.html.twig') }}{% verbatim %}<p><a href="##attestation.url##">Verificare e firmare la mia attestazione</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block attestation_reminder__fr_FR_subject %}{% verbatim %}Rappel : attestation de détention à signer{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block attestation_reminder__fr_FR_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>Bonjour ##attestation.user##,</p><p>Votre attestation de détention de matériel attend toujours votre réponse (date limite : ##attestation.deadline##).</p>{% endverbatim %}{{ include('@assetsign/notifications/_item_list.html.twig') }}{% verbatim %}<p><a href="##attestation.url##">Vérifier et signer mon attestation</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block attestation_reminder__en_GB_subject %}{% verbatim %}Reminder: equipment holding attestation to sign{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block attestation_reminder__en_GB_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>Hello ##attestation.user##,</p><p>Your equipment holding attestation is still awaiting your answer (deadline: ##attestation.deadline##).</p>{% endverbatim %}{{ include('@assetsign/notifications/_item_list.html.twig') }}{% verbatim %}<p><a href="##attestation.url##">Check and sign my attestation</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block attestation_reminder__es_ES_subject %}{% verbatim %}Recordatorio: certificación de tenencia por firmar{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block attestation_reminder__es_ES_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>Hola ##attestation.user##,</p><p>Su certificación de tenencia de material sigue pendiente de respuesta (fecha límite: ##attestation.deadline##).</p>{% endverbatim %}{{ include('@assetsign/notifications/_item_list.html.twig') }}{% verbatim %}<p><a href="##attestation.url##">Comprobar y firmar mi certificación</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block attestation_reminder__de_DE_subject %}{% verbatim %}Erinnerung: Bestätigung des Gerätebesitzes{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block attestation_reminder__de_DE_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>Hallo ##attestation.user##,</p><p>Ihre Bestätigung des Gerätebesitzes wartet noch auf Ihre Antwort (Frist: ##attestation.deadline##).</p>{% endverbatim %}{{ include('@assetsign/notifications/_item_list.html.twig') }}{% verbatim %}<p><a href="##attestation.url##">Bestätigung prüfen und unterschreiben</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block attestation_reminder__it_IT_subject %}{% verbatim %}Promemoria: attestazione di detenzione da firmare{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block attestation_reminder__it_IT_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>Buongiorno ##attestation.user##,</p><p>La sua attestazione di detenzione dell'attrezzatura è ancora in attesa di risposta (scadenza: ##attestation.deadline##).</p>{% endverbatim %}{{ include('@assetsign/notifications/_item_list.html.twig') }}{% verbatim %}<p><a href="##attestation.url##">Verificare e firmare la mia attestazione</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block attestation_discrepancy__fr_FR_subject %}{% verbatim %}Écart d'inventaire signalé par ##attestation.user##{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block attestation_discrepancy__fr_FR_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>##attestation.user## signale un écart dans sa liste de matériel (campagne ##attestation.campaign##) :</p><p>##attestation.comment##</p>{% endverbatim %}{{ include('@assetsign/notifications/_item_list.html.twig') }}{% verbatim %}<p>Ticket n°##attestation.ticket##.</p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block attestation_discrepancy__en_GB_subject %}{% verbatim %}Inventory discrepancy reported by ##attestation.user##{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block attestation_discrepancy__en_GB_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>##attestation.user## reports a discrepancy in their equipment list (campaign ##attestation.campaign##):</p><p>##attestation.comment##</p>{% endverbatim %}{{ include('@assetsign/notifications/_item_list.html.twig') }}{% verbatim %}<p>Ticket ###attestation.ticket##.</p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block attestation_discrepancy__es_ES_subject %}{% verbatim %}Discrepancia de inventario indicada por ##attestation.user##{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block attestation_discrepancy__es_ES_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>##attestation.user## indica una discrepancia en su lista de material (campaña ##attestation.campaign##):</p><p>##attestation.comment##</p>{% endverbatim %}{{ include('@assetsign/notifications/_item_list.html.twig') }}{% verbatim %}<p>Ticket n.º ##attestation.ticket##.</p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block attestation_discrepancy__de_DE_subject %}{% verbatim %}Inventarabweichung gemeldet von ##attestation.user##{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block attestation_discrepancy__de_DE_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>##attestation.user## meldet eine Abweichung in der Geräteliste (Kampagne ##attestation.campaign##):</p><p>##attestation.comment##</p>{% endverbatim %}{{ include('@assetsign/notifications/_item_list.html.twig') }}{% verbatim %}<p>Ticket Nr. ##attestation.ticket##.</p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block attestation_discrepancy__it_IT_subject %}{% verbatim %}Discrepanza di inventario segnalata da ##attestation.user##{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block attestation_discrepancy__it_IT_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>##attestation.user## segnala una discrepanza nel suo elenco di attrezzatura (campagna ##attestation.campaign##):</p><p>##attestation.comment##</p>{% endverbatim %}{{ include('@assetsign/notifications/_item_list.html.twig') }}{% verbatim %}<p>Ticket n. ##attestation.ticket##.</p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block charter_invitation__fr_FR_subject %}{% verbatim %}Charte informatique à signer : ##attestation.campaign##{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block charter_invitation__fr_FR_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>Bonjour ##attestation.user##,</p><p>Merci de prendre connaissance de la charte informatique et de la signer avant le ##attestation.deadline##.</p><p><a href="##attestation.url##">Lire et signer la charte</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block charter_invitation__en_GB_subject %}{% verbatim %}IT charter to sign: ##attestation.campaign##{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block charter_invitation__en_GB_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>Hello ##attestation.user##,</p><p>Please read the IT charter and sign it before ##attestation.deadline##.</p><p><a href="##attestation.url##">Read and sign the charter</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block charter_invitation__es_ES_subject %}{% verbatim %}Normativa informática por firmar: ##attestation.campaign##{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block charter_invitation__es_ES_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>Hola ##attestation.user##,</p><p>Lea la normativa informática y fírmela antes del ##attestation.deadline##.</p><p><a href="##attestation.url##">Leer y firmar la normativa</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block charter_invitation__de_DE_subject %}{% verbatim %}IT-Nutzungsrichtlinie zu unterschreiben: ##attestation.campaign##{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block charter_invitation__de_DE_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>Hallo ##attestation.user##,</p><p>Bitte lesen Sie die IT-Nutzungsrichtlinie und unterschreiben Sie sie bis zum ##attestation.deadline##.</p><p><a href="##attestation.url##">Richtlinie lesen und unterschreiben</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block charter_invitation__it_IT_subject %}{% verbatim %}Regolamento informatico da firmare: ##attestation.campaign##{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block charter_invitation__it_IT_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>Buongiorno ##attestation.user##,</p><p>La preghiamo di leggere il regolamento informatico e di firmarlo entro il ##attestation.deadline##.</p><p><a href="##attestation.url##">Leggere e firmare il regolamento</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block charter_reminder__fr_FR_subject %}{% verbatim %}Rappel : charte informatique à signer{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block charter_reminder__fr_FR_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>Bonjour ##attestation.user##,</p><p>La charte informatique attend toujours votre signature (date limite : ##attestation.deadline##).</p><p><a href="##attestation.url##">Lire et signer la charte</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block charter_reminder__en_GB_subject %}{% verbatim %}Reminder: IT charter to sign{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block charter_reminder__en_GB_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>Hello ##attestation.user##,</p><p>The IT charter is still awaiting your signature (deadline: ##attestation.deadline##).</p><p><a href="##attestation.url##">Read and sign the charter</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block charter_reminder__es_ES_subject %}{% verbatim %}Recordatorio: normativa informática por firmar{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block charter_reminder__es_ES_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>Hola ##attestation.user##,</p><p>La normativa informática sigue pendiente de su firma (fecha límite: ##attestation.deadline##).</p><p><a href="##attestation.url##">Leer y firmar la normativa</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block charter_reminder__de_DE_subject %}{% verbatim %}Erinnerung: IT-Nutzungsrichtlinie zu unterschreiben{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block charter_reminder__de_DE_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>Hallo ##attestation.user##,</p><p>Die IT-Nutzungsrichtlinie wartet noch auf Ihre Unterschrift (Frist: ##attestation.deadline##).</p><p><a href="##attestation.url##">Richtlinie lesen und unterschreiben</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block charter_reminder__it_IT_subject %}{% verbatim %}Promemoria: regolamento informatico da firmare{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
{%- block charter_reminder__it_IT_html %}{% verbatim %}<p>Buongiorno ##attestation.user##,</p><p>Il regolamento informatico è ancora in attesa della sua firma (scadenza: ##attestation.deadline##).</p><p><a href="##attestation.url##">Leggere e firmare il regolamento</a></p>{% endverbatim %}{% endblock -%}
